license, including changes to them. Separately licensed third-party material
remains subject to its own terms.

"Library" means the ManagedBlf parsing library, including its models, reader,
handle facade, and message decoder, and modifications or adaptations of those
components. Merely moving, renaming, or incorporating Library code into another
file or program does not remove that code from this definition. An application
that uses the Library is not itself part of the Library solely because it uses it.

"Commercial Use" means use for a for-profit business, paid or commissioned work,
a product or service intended to generate revenue, commercial research or
development, or internal business operations or tools. Commercial Use includes
these activities even when the Software, resulting application, or service is
not sold, charged for, or distributed. "Noncommercial Use" means use that does
not fall within this definition.

